* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff2 binary

# `meddata-mini` is checksum-pinned: its own `checksums.sha256` covers every file, and the importer
# refuses the dataset if one byte moves. Line-ending normalization would do exactly that, so git is told
# to leave these files alone.
packages/prescriptions/test/fixtures/meddata-mini-*/** -text
